#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Welcome to HX, a lightweight, flexible HTTP framework for Go that "
"simplifies request handling and data extraction."
msgstr "欢迎使用 HX，一个轻量级、灵活的 Go HTTP 框架，可简化请求处理和数据提取。"

#: ../../index.rst:17
msgid "Features"
msgstr "特性"

#: ../../index.rst:19
msgid "🚀 **Lightweight and fast** - Minimal overhead with maximum performance"
msgstr "🚀 **轻量且快速** - 开销小，性能高"

#: ../../index.rst:20
msgid ""
"💪 **Type-safe request data extraction** - Compile-time safety for request"
" handling"
msgstr "💪 **类型安全的请求数据提取** - 在编译期保证请求处理的类型安全"

#: ../../index.rst:21
msgid ""
"🔄 **Automatic request binding** - Seamless data binding from various "
"sources"
msgstr "🔄 **自动请求绑定** - 从多种来源无缝绑定数据"

#: ../../index.rst:22
msgid "🛠 **Extensible design** - Easy to extend and customize"
msgstr "🛠 **可扩展设计** - 易于扩展和定制"

